//-->
    </script>We reserve the right to reject entries for these criteria:
<br />
- Too much AI. (&quot;Too much&quot; is up to the whims of the SMS Power! elves and cannot be defined.)     <script type="text/javascript">      
<!--
        document.write('</div>');      
//-->
    </script>  </div></blockquote>
<br />
We may want to clarify this a little better before the competition happens, but in the current climate the general intention is that an entry where e.g. ~10% of the work is aided by AI would likely be accepted (e.g. an additional language, selected artwork), but an entry where ~50% of the work is done by AI wouldn't. This is not a firm rule here, but sort of aim to provide a general background intent about this.</span><br />
